    CLK (SCK)   ->  D8
    DC          ->  D7
    CS          ->  D5
    RST         ->  D9
    VCC         ->  5V (or 3.3V depending on your module)
    GND         ->  GND

PUSH BUTTON:
    Button Pin 1  ->  D2 (Arduino)
    Button Pin 2  ->  GND
    
    NOTE: Like Stop The Bar, this game uses EDGE DETECTION (checking 
    for the transition from not-pressed to pressed) rather than 
    continuous state reading. This ensures each physical tap registers 
    as exactly ONE input event, regardless of how briefly or long the 
    button is held. If your button reads LOW when pressed (opposite of 
    this code's assumption), change the comparison in updateGame() from 
    "currentButtonState == HIGH && lastButtonState == LOW" accordingly.

